# Retail Sales & Margin Power BI Dashboard

## Business Problem

The goal of this project is to analyze retail sales, gross profit, profit margin, discount impact, product performance, and customer segments.

## Dataset

Retail Sales Dataset  
Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/buharishehu/retail-sales-dataset

## Tools Used

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Modeling

## Key KPIs

- Total Sales
- Total Orders
- Average Order Value
- Gross Profit
- Profit Margin %
- Sales YoY %
- Sales by Product
- Sales by Region
- Discount Impact

## Planned Report Pages

1. Executive Summary
2. Sales & Margin Trend
3. Product Performance
4. Customer Analysis
5. Region / Store / Channel Analysis

## Planned Files

- sales_margin_dashboard.pbix
- dax_measures.md
- data_model.png
- screenshots/

## Status

In progress
